meta {
  name: 18 Data user cannot open the operator debug view (403)
  type: http
  seq: 18
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/debug/phase26
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Cookie: {{cookieName}}={{sessionTokenResearcher}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 403
}

docs {
  A session is not enough: the route is EDC_ADMIN. 17 proves it refuses no
  session, this proves it refuses the wrong role, and `05 Dataspace Operator/28` proves
  the operator still gets through. /api/nlq/backend was public by the decision in #377
  until ADR-044 (#404) gated every route; `24` asserts its 401.
}
